Third-party data sources used by default
----------------------------------------

The hub fetches the following data from sources it does not control. They are maintained by the
CLIProxyAPI community, not by this project.

Model catalogs (refreshed every three hours; override with models.catalog,
models.codex-catalog and models.devin-catalog, or use the embedded catalogs with -local-model):

  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/router-for-me/models/refs/heads/main/models.json
  https://models.router-for.me/models.json
  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/router-for-me/models/refs/heads/main/codex_client_models.json
  https://models.router-for.me/codex_client_models.json
  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/router-for-me/models/refs/heads/main/devin_models.json
  https://models.router-for.me/devin_models.json

Plugin store registry (read only when the plugin store is used through the web panel or the
management API; extra registries can be added with plugins.store-sources):

  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/router-for-me/CLIProxyAPI-Plugins-Store/main/registry.json
